        "kicker": "ACT I",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第一幕 · 高更来了",
          "en": "Gauguin arrives"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1888年秋天，梵高等了很久的高更终于来到阿尔勒，住进了黄房子。",
          "en": "In autumn 1888, after Van Gogh had waited so long, Gauguin finally arrived in Arles and moved into the Yellow House."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/arlesiennes-mistral.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "高更《阿尔勒的女人（密史脱拉风）》1888，芝加哥艺术博物馆",
          "en": "Paul Gauguin, Arlésiennes (Mistral), 1888, Art Institute of Chicago"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1888年 · 芝加哥艺术博物馆",
          "en": "1888 · Art Institute of Chicago"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT II",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第二幕 · 同一座花园",
          "en": "The same garden"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "黄房子对面有一座公园。高更画下了它，梵高也画过它。两人看的是同一座花园，画出来却完全不一样。",
          "en": "Across from the Yellow House was a public garden. Gauguin painted it, and so did Van Gogh. They looked at the same garden, but painted it in completely different ways."
        }
      },
      {
        "image": "images/arlesiennes-mistral.jpg",
        "alt": {
          "zh": "高更《阿尔勒的女人（密史脱拉风）》1888，芝加哥艺术博物馆",
          "en": "Paul Gauguin, Arlésiennes (Mistral), 1888, Art Institute of Chicago"
        },
        "caption": {
          "zh": "1888年 · 芝加哥艺术博物馆",
          "en": "1888 · Art Institute of Chicago"
        },
        "kicker": "ACT III",
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 来到芝加哥",
          "en": "To Chicago"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1934年，芝加哥艺术博物馆买下了这幅画。今天，它和梵高、修拉、莫奈的许多作品一起，收藏在芝加哥。",
          "en": "In 1934, the Art Institute of Chicago acquired this painting. Today it is in Chicago, alongside many works by Van Gogh, Seurat and Monet."
        }
      }
