        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "黄房子对面有一座公园。高更画下了它，梵高也画过它。两人看的是同一座花园，画出来却完全不一样。",
          "en": "Across from the Yellow House was a public garden. Gauguin painted it, and so did Van Gogh. They looked at the same garden, but painted it in completely different ways."
        }
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "zh": "第三幕 · 来到芝加哥",
          "en": "To Chicago"
        },
        "text": {
          "zh": "1934年，芝加哥艺术博物馆买下了这幅画。今天，它和梵高、修拉、莫奈的许多作品一起，收藏在芝加哥。",
          "en": "In 1934, the Art Institute of Chicago acquired this painting. Today it is in Chicago, alongside many works by Van Gogh, Seurat and Monet."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
